  Key Result: HiSMD-Net achieves the highest APS (+5.73 pp over UAVDet) with
  16.7% fewer parameters, validating the effectiveness of ASRFR pre-backbone
  reconstruction and the Stride-2 Sub-Pixel Pyramid Head in resolving Gap 1.


